# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated report artefacts.
#
# reports/ holds only what a reader needs: memos, methodology, frozen
# specifications, research summaries, the headline tables that verify the
# README, and archive provenance. Everything a phase script regenerates -
# per-trade, per-day and per-option dumps, and the per-phase figure sets - is
# ignored so a re-run cannot quietly add ~18 MB back.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
reports/**/figures/
reports/**/*_ledger.csv
reports/**/*_daily.csv
reports/**/daily_*.csv
reports/**/entry_greeks.csv
reports/**/option_greeks.csv
reports/**/chain_positions*.csv
reports/**/trade_*.csv
reports/**/walkforward_parameter_state.csv
reports/**/heston_calibration.csv
reports/**/heston_parameter_history.csv
reports/**/capped_variance_pricing.csv
reports/**/capped_variance_sensitivity.csv
reports/**/model_free_variance_diagnostics.csv
reports/**/signals.csv
reports/archive/**/*.csv
reports/archive/**/*.png

# Default output paths of the removed diagnostics CLI; historical outputs are
# archived under reports/archive/.
reports/diagnostics/
reports/local_eod/
reports/diagnostic_eod/
